  "privacyLocalTitle": "Your data stays on your device",
  "privacyLocalBody": "Downloaded books, favorites, your last reading position, your settings and the last Ask Adeeb answer are stored only on your device. Reading, search and listening work offline, and listening uses your device's text-to-speech engine.",
  "privacyAskTitle": "Ask Adeeb questions",
  "privacyAskBody": "When you ask, your question and excerpts from your downloaded books are sent to our server and then to Google's Gemini service to write the answer. Google may use what it receives to improve its services, and human reviewers may read it. Our server doesn't store the text of your question.",
  "privacyPersonalTitle": "Don't share personal information",
  "privacyPersonalBody": "Don't include your name, contact details or any personal or confidential information in your question.",
  "privacyDeviceTitle": "A random device identifier",
  "privacyDeviceBody": "The app creates a random identifier stored on your device and sends it with questions only to count the daily limit; it isn't linked to your identity or to system identifiers. Our server (on Cloudflare) sees your device's IP address, and from it and the identifier stores an irreversible encrypted value (HMAC) in the daily-limit counters for one day only, after which it is deleted. It never stores the identifier or the IP address as is.",
  "privacyAgeTitle": "Ask Adeeb is for people aged 18 or over",
  "privacyAgeBody": "Gemini's terms require users to be 18 or over, so you're asked to confirm your age before your first question. Reading, search and listening are available to everyone.",
  "privacyNetworkTitle": "Connections",
  "privacyNetworkBody": "The app connects to GitHub to download the book list and book files, and to our server only when you use Ask Adeeb, always over HTTPS.",
  "privacyAdsTitle": "No ads, no tracking",
  "privacyAdsBody": "No ads, no analytics, no crash reports and no tracking of any kind.",
